{"id":467,"date":"2026-05-15T07:05:12","date_gmt":"2026-05-15T07:05:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cabopharmacy.com\/faq\/"},"modified":"2026-05-15T07:05:12","modified_gmt":"2026-05-15T07:05:12","slug":"faq","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/cabopharmacy.com\/faq\/","title":{"rendered":"FAQ"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Everything you need to know about ordering wellness essentials from Cabo Pharmacy \u2014 delivery times, coverage, payment methods and more. Still have a question? <a href=\"\/contact\/\">Contact us<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>What products do you deliver?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>We deliver over-the-counter (OTC) wellness essentials including vitamins, pain relief, cold &#038; flu, skincare, sun care, baby care, eye care, dental care, antacids, first aid and more.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>How fast is delivery?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Typical delivery times: Cabo San Lucas core 30\u201360 min, San Jos\u00e9 del Cabo 45\u201390 min, Tourist Corridor 60\u201390 min. Times may vary depending on traffic and order volume. We&#8217;re available 24\/7.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>Do you deliver to hotels?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Yes. We deliver to all major hotels, resorts, villas and private residences across our coverage area. We can coordinate with hotel concierge if you&#8217;re not in your room.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>What areas do you cover?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Cabo San Lucas, San Jos\u00e9 del Cabo, Tourist Corridor (Palmilla, Querencia, Cabo Real, Diamante), and La Paz on request.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>How can I place an order?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Three easy ways: WhatsApp\/call +52 624 226 1023, email help@cabopharmacy.com, or shop online at cabopharmacy.com.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>What payment methods do you accept?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>We accept cash in USD and Mexican pesos, all major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), Apple Pay and Google Pay.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>Are your prices in USD or MXN?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Prices on our website are listed in USD for traveler convenience. Cash payments accepted in either USD or MXN at current exchange rate.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>Do you sell medicines that need a doctor’s order?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>No. Cabo Pharmacy delivers over-the-counter (OTC) wellness essentials only. Medicines that need a doctor’s order require a medical consultation.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>Are you available on weekends and holidays?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Yes. Our store is open 8 AM – 11 PM every day, including weekends and holidays.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>Do you offer Spanish customer service?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>Yes \u2014 our team is fully bilingual. You can communicate in English or Spanish via WhatsApp, phone, or in person.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>Is there a minimum order amount?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>No. There is no minimum order.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary><strong>Can I return a product?<\/strong><\/summary>\n<p>For health and safety reasons, most OTC products are non-returnable once delivered, in line with standard pharmacy industry practices. Contact us within 24 hours if there&#8217;s an issue with your order.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What products do you deliver?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We deliver over-the-counter (OTC) wellness essentials including vitamins, pain relief, cold & flu, skincare, sun care, baby care, eye care, dental care, antacids, first aid and more.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How fast is delivery?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Typical delivery times: Cabo San Lucas core 30\u201360 min, San Jos\u00e9 del Cabo 45\u201390 min, Tourist Corridor 60\u201390 min. Times may vary depending on traffic and order volume. We're available 24\/7.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you deliver to hotels?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We deliver to all major hotels, resorts, villas and private residences across our coverage area. We can coordinate with hotel concierge if you're not in your room.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What areas do you cover?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Cabo San Lucas, San Jos\u00e9 del Cabo, Tourist Corridor (Palmilla, Querencia, Cabo Real, Diamante), and La Paz on request.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can I place an order?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Three easy ways: WhatsApp\/call +52 624 226 1023, email help@cabopharmacy.com, or shop online at cabopharmacy.com.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What payment methods do you accept?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We accept cash in USD and Mexican pesos, all major credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), Apple Pay and Google Pay.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are your prices in USD or MXN?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Prices on our website are listed in USD for traveler convenience. Cash payments accepted in either USD or MXN at current exchange rate.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you sell medicines that need a doctor’s order?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Cabo Pharmacy delivers over-the-counter (OTC) wellness essentials only. Medicines that need a doctor’s order require a medical consultation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are you available on weekends and holidays?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Our store is open 8 AM – 11 PM every day, including weekends and holidays.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you offer Spanish customer service?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes \u2014 our team is fully bilingual. You can communicate in English or Spanish via WhatsApp, phone, or in person.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is there a minimum order amount?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. There is no minimum order.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I return a product?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For health and safety reasons, most OTC products are non-returnable once delivered, in line with standard pharmacy industry practices. Contact us within 24 hours if there's an issue with your order.\"}}]}<\/script>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:30px;\"><strong>Need something not listed here?<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/5216242261023\">Message us on WhatsApp<\/a> or <a href=\"\/contact\/\">use our contact form<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered"